{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T01:06:35.968Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7f18c40b3690c469de08cfa3a4647d3141a8b4f75b85a50ce5e2724988dbeb98","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","text":"@ruth.calloway Set up. A 'Strategic pod brief' will be posted here each morning at 07:45 Chicago time, starting tomorrow (15 Oct), covering new messages in #strategic-pod, #strategic-random and #inc-vtg-hartford. Finance figures and documents will be left out of the brief; the brief will say a finance item was discussed and point to the channel. Caveat: the scheduler is not running on this host yet, so the brief won't post until the Hermes gateway is started."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
